id: detect/repeatable
name: Repeat runs answer the same to the letter
prose: |
  Running detect twice on each test picture prints byte-identical answers, as the wish demands of a repeat run.
scope:
- src/**
- Cargo.toml
- Cargo.lock
- build
- materials/bordered.jpg
- materials/clear.jpg
covers:
- R1
- R3
rows:
- run: ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg && ./brim detect materials/bordered.jpg && ./brim detect materials/clear.jpg && ./brim detect materials/clear.jpg
  expect:
    rc: 0
    out: |
      4 4 4 4
      4 4 4 4
      0 0 0 0
      0 0 0 0
